          "kicker": "Eligibility watch",
          "heading": "Fiji's Koli Sewabu says FRU is tracking Mark Nawaqanitawase's possible switch",
          "body": "Mark Nawaqanitawase has yet to confirm his international allegiance, and Fiji's union is now watching closely. FRU chief executive Koli Sewabu said: \"We are aware of the potential switch Mark could make at the next World Cup and follow this with interest.\" The winger's agent has said he is weighing a possible switch, and he is eligible for Fiji, Italy and Australia after his three-year stand-down. Wallabies coach Les Kiss says he will wait until the end of the year to see where the player sits."
